  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) package medium seashell pasta",
    "1 pound sliced bacon",
    "2 tomatoes, chopped",
    "1 small onion, chopped",
    "1.5 cups light Ranch-style salad dressing",
    "1/2 teaspoon freshly ground black pepper",
    "1 romaine heart, shredded (about 3 cups)"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-U6fXdITS9SboHVL5cptfBNBY4Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/72823-blt-pasta-salad-VAT-003-step-01-22010aacc7414cb0a68037a6fb003815.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/72823/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil; add pasta, and cook until tender, about 8 minutes. Drain, and rinse under cold water to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ji7p_joaK4JdgYoryOig9zRDLcE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/72823-blt-pasta-salad-VAT-004-step-02-364c92d6b9d046eebe3264068eaec68f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/72823/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, cook bacon in a large deep skillet over medium-high heat until browned and crisp.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RPe307Ks4bABAtcsgs-FyMbqtAg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/72823-blt-pasta-salad-VAT-005-step-03-ab0b38df145c4dcebadab624e344c7ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/72823/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the pan and drain on paper towels; crumble and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uDrPXrqEpD2pVlVwF7xDaMc-ebI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/72823-blt-pasta-salad-VAT-006-step-04-5af2d512c8724bf4ae3b1e75d985f901.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/72823/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine cooked pasta, 3/4 of the bacon, tomatoes, onion, ranch dressing, and pepper in a large bowl; toss to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u_KLsCV48J5f93Q0cD9AFIFrnBY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/72823-blt-pasta-salad-VAT-007-step-05-bae5dda625934fdeb71c57e3295e34e4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/72823/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in lettuce. Top with remaining bacon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
